        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are committed to sustainability through our work, which modernizes infrastructure to serve the future, and in our operations where we adhere to an internal set of guiding principles that ensure we operate with the highest standards of integrity and sustain a lasting business.",
        "start_character": 4895,
        "end_character": 5174
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001981599-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001981599-26-000020-96962af110aec789",
        "accession_number": "0001981599-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are one of the few utility infrastructure service providers that is maintenance-oriented, distribution-focused and have no exposure to cross-country pipeline projects.",
        "start_character": 9414,
        "end_character": 9584
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001981599-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001981599-26-000020-96962af110aec789",
        "accession_number": "0001981599-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We renamed the segment to reflect the expanded scope of services offered by the segment following our acquisition of Connect Atlantic Utility Services Corporation (“Connect”), which is included in this segment.",
        "start_character": 5568,
        "end_character": 5778
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001981599-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001981599-26-000020-96962af110aec789",
        "accession_number": "0001981599-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Collectively, we embrace a culture of inclusion to not only protect employees under laws designed to do so, but to reinforce a sense of belonging for all employees in the workplace.",
        "start_character": 19719,
        "end_character": 19900
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001981599-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001981599-26-000020-96962af110aec789",
        "accession_number": "0001981599-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe that increasing power demands driven by AI, advanced manufacturing, and an increase in overall consumer energy use will also require additional infrastructure to support North American energy networks.",
        "start_character": 10430,
        "end_character": 10642
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001981599-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001981599-26-000020-96962af110aec789",
        "accession_number": "0001981599-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We maintain a competitive market-based total rewards strategy to attract, retain, motivate and develop employees.",
        "start_character": 19407,
        "end_character": 19520
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001981599-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001981599-26-000020-96962af110aec789",
        "accession_number": "0001981599-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We operate in a highly competitive and highly fragmented industry, as we compete with many regional and local providers.",
        "start_character": 12085,
        "end_character": 12205
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001981599-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001981599-26-000020-96962af110aec789",
        "accession_number": "0001981599-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We operate through a family of complementary companies that work together across different geographies, allowing us to establish solid customer relationships and a strong reputation for a wide range of capabilities.",
        "start_character": 2360,
        "end_character": 2575
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001981599-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001981599-26-000020-96962af110aec789",
        "accession_number": "0001981599-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We place a strong emphasis on employee training and development and have implemented a robust safety program that strives to ensure all projects are executed with the highest level of safety and quality standards.",
        "start_character": 2146,
        "end_character": 2359
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001981599-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001981599-26-000020-96962af110aec789",
        "accession_number": "0001981599-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We are a leading North American utility and energy infrastructure services company with over 115 years of operating history, and we partner with regulated utilities to maintain, upgrade and expand the energy network that powers millions of homes and businesses.",
        "start_character": 26,
        "end_character": 287
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001981599-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001981599-26-000020-96962af110aec789",
        "accession_number": "0001981599-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.88,
        "statement": "Our service offerings primarily consist of the modernization of utility infrastructure through the replacement, maintenance, retrofitting, and installation of electric and natural gas distribution and utility-scale transmission networks and building capacity to meet current and future demands.",
        "start_character": 551,
        "end_character": 845
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001981599-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001981599-26-000020-96962af110aec789",
        "accession_number": "0001981599-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "Additionally, we are strongly positioned to support the infrastructure needed to connect renewable energy to existing distribution systems.",
